      "method": "OpenStreetMap way 101986702 (Modane/French portal to the France-Italy border, 48 nodes) concatenated with way 317397424 reversed (border to Bardonecchia/Italian portal, 29 nodes); the two ways' nearest endpoints are 35 m apart at the border and are not otherwise joined by a shared node or relation. Fetched node-by-node via the standard OpenStreetMap read API (api.openstreetmap.org/api/0.6), not Overpass, because Overpass (overpass-api.de, its lz4 mirror, and overpass.kumi.systems) refused every connection attempt this session; see the facility worklog.",
